For me I have repro on Pixel 6 Pro using latest Android and Chrome

To try to debug this, I opened [DartPad ](https://dartpad.dev/) from **Chrome on my iPhone**, pasted the following source code and ran it.

Then something strange happened.
The message "Script error." printed several times in a console, and **a blank white space appeared at the further down on the DartPad screen.**

```

import 'package:flutter/material.dart';

void main() {
  runApp(MaterialApp(
    builder: (context, child) => const MyApp(),
  ));
}

class MyApp extends StatefulWidget {
  const MyApp({super.key});

